BSD-2-Clause-Patent.  That is a separate upstream project by other authors;
this package is not its author and only ports the units listed below with
attribution:

  - Drivers/A733HdmiDxe (edk2-a733: Drivers/SunxiHdmiDxe)
  - Library/A733DisplayClockLib, Library/A733PowerLib,
    Library/A733HdmiModeLib
  - Platform/Radxa/CubieA7APkg/Drivers/CubieA7ALogoDxe (bitmap
    regenerated at 1920x1080 for this board's HDMI panel; Logo.c is
    Intel's MdeModulePkg LogoDxe via edk2-a733)
  - Drivers/BootAndroid, Drivers/BootDebian (OS hand-off)
  - Platform/Radxa/CubieA7APkg/sun60i-a733-cubie-a7a.dtb (the board's
    device tree, compiled from the vendor DTS)
  - Platform/Radxa/CubieA7APkg/scp_dts.dtb (the ARISC configuration FDT;
    its /dram node is the board's sys_config.fex [dram_para] block)
  - Include/A733Display.h and Include/VarStoreData.h (originally from
    edk2-rockchip's platform headers, via edk2-a733)
  - Include/Guid/A733EdidInfo.h, Include/A733SetupFormSetGuid.h

Every one of those files carries the derivation line and the original
copyright notices next to this package's own:

  Portions derived from edk2-a733 (github.com/vehoelite/edk2-a733),
  Copyright (c) 2026 carpi-os contributors, BSD-2-Clause-Patent.

The rename from Sunxi* to A733* is editorial; the register sequences,
timing values and program structure are the ported ones.

